# Smoother frames (Application SpaceWarp, the owner's ask, 0.1.17): the eyes' motion images, as the Quest's runtime
# takes them beside each eye. Each shot saves the left eye's motion as <shot>-motion.png (red right, green up, from grey)
# and logs its numbers ([sim] motion): standing still nearly nothing moves; turning the head left the level moves right
# (across > 0) while the hands, which turn with the head, stay; a walk spreads out from the middle; the right hand raised
# alone moves only it, up; a jump of the head is a cut (given 0); looking up moves the level down (up < 0).
